ores/Todos.test.ts`, depends on TASK-2.\\n\\nI flagged a separate, likely-unrelated observation (Kanban board never shows a backlog column) as out-of-scope rather than turning it into a task, since it doesn't match the brief and would expand scope unnecessarily.\\n\\nI did not modify `brief.md`, `implementation.md`, or `verdict.md` — those are template placeholders owned by other roles (product/developer/reviewer) and out of scope for the analyst step.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2311,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":93224,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":2311},\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"fd3cae6c-0d02-4a69-a97e-0e9b7deb5543\",\"uuid\":\"f0f00621-a048-4a78-a4d6-3864e691390f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-01T15:19:42.975Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CecwjvjnhMJgqVUPJHfBt\"}\n {\"type\":\"rate_limit_event\",\"rate_limit_info\":{\"status\":\"allowed\",\"resetsAt\":1788285600,\"rateLimitType\":\"five_hour\",\"overageStatus\":\"rejected\",\"overageDisabledReason\":\"org_level_disabled\",\"isUsingOverage\":false,\"unifiedWindows\":{\"five_hour\":{\"utilization\":0.64,\"resetsAt\":1788285600},\"seven_day\":{\"utilization\":0.19,\"resetsAt\":1788663600}}},\"uuid\":\"9470f3c3-317b-4768-aa4a-c59218a6a869\",\"session_id\":\"fd3cae6c-0d02-4a69-a97e-0e9b7deb5543\"}\n {\"duration_api_ms\":353839,\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"session_id\":\"fd3cae6c-0d02-4a69-a97e-0e9b7deb5543\",\"total_cost_usd\":1.0637938,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":62,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":95535,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":1774529,\"output_tokens\":32552,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":25239},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"